# GMS raises the shield by chance when hit, for ninety seconds and ten blows,
# and it can't be raised again for thirty seconds from when it went up. All of
# that is built, using Buff.shield: the shell blocks whole hits and breaks as
# soon as its count runs out, timer or not.
#
# The chance of it going up is dropped: it is certain at max level, and a buff
# is either up or not. Its attack is permanent, as GMS says, and outlasts the
# shell.
#
# GMS's damage reduction applies "only for attacks that inflict damage at a
# certain ratio of the max HP". Nothing here deals damage that way, so bosses
# stand in for them, as with Holy Magic Shell.
#
# GMS's own ten levels, exact at every level.
name: "Divine Shield"
description:
  "When struck, generates a shield that blocks a number of blows and "
  "permanently increases your Attack Power."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_WHITE_KNIGHT skill_order: 8 }
max_level: 10
base { attack: 2 }
per_level { attack: 2 }
buff {
  duration_seconds: 90.0
  shield {
    hits: 1.0
    hits_per_level: 1.0
    boss_damage_taken_pct: 0.07
  }
}
cooldown_seconds: 30.0
